@SpotifyCares Yes. There's no option to specify download location if I format the SD card to be used as extra internal storage (which is what it should be), only if I format it as removable storage.

@SpotifyCares You mean this is intended behaviour? That's... not great. So I can either be able to move apps to SD or download music to SD but not both. Wasn't the case in the past.

spotify_reply:
@274500 Hi Justen, help's arrived! Just to check, have you followed the exact steps here: https://t.co/zEMYB82ZiG? /FJ

@274500 Thanks! This is because if you format it as an extra internal storage, the app will also read it as an internal memory. This means the app will not detect any removable storage, and this option will not appear. Hope this clarifies things /JP

@274500 We understand. It's currently not possible to save the app to an SD card. Rest assured your feedback will be passed on to the right folks /PX

